    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Beautifully presented and exceptionally spacious 5-bedroom detached residence, occupying a most generous 0.59 Hectare / 1.46 Acre site in a peaceful and accessible rural location. The property has been extensively upgraded and modernised in recent years, with significant improvements including a new roof, new insulation and upgraded internal fit out. The accommodation is bright, very well maintained and offers excellent flexibility for modern family living.\r\n\r\nInternally, the property provides generous and well-proportioned accommodation extending over two floors. The ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall, spacious living room with solid fuel stove, dining room, large kitchen, utility room, bathroom and three bedrooms – one of which is ideal as a home office. \r\n\r\nThe first floor provides two exceptionally large bedrooms, including a superb principal bedroom with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite.\r\n\r\nThe living accommodation is particularly impressive, with the remodelled living room featuring a solid fuel stove, attractive feature wall and fireplace and French doors. The large kitchen has been recently upgraded with extensive cabinetry, worktops, tiling and quality appliances.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property enjoys a generous and mature site with a long driveway with dual gated access and excellent parking, a large garage / workshop, garden store and a covered patio area providing an attractive sheltered space for outdoor living.\r\nThe residence offers a lovely balance of tranquil, countryside living, within easy driving distance to the nearby towns of Ballintogher, Dromahair, Riverstown and Ballyfarnon while being only 20 km from Sligo town and all amenities. A local school bus service operates to Coola Secondary School and St Joseph’s Primary School, Ballinagar.\r\n\r\nThis is a substantial and very well-appointed family home which has benefited from considerable investment and upgrading. With its generous accommodation, outbuildings, and peaceful setting, this lovely home represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a ready-to-occupy family residence. Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\nNew polished porcelain tile flooring.\r\nRecessed LED lighting.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n5.3m x 4.5m\r\nFeature wall incorporating a contemporary stone tiled fireplace surround, timber mantel and solid fuel stove. \r\nTimber laminate floor. French doors to patio\r\n\r\nDining Room\r\n4.1m x 3.0m\r\nPorcelain tile floor. Archway to Kitchen\r\nRecessed LED lighting.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n5.5m x 4.0m\r\nPorcelain tile floor. Recently installed, extensive fitted kitchen units, with grey quartz / stone-effect worktop with inset sink. Belling range style cooker - gas hob & electric oven. Utility cupboard with washing machine and shelving. Recessed LED lighting.\r\nDoor to a covered outdoor patio area, creating a superb sheltered space for outdoor living.\r\n\r\nUtility room\r\n4.1m x 2.5m\r\nLaminate wood flooring. Fitted cupboards. Patio door to rear. Recessed LED lighting.\r\n\r\nBedroom No.3\r\n3.4m x 3.1m\r\n\r\nBedroom No.4\r\n4.3m x 3.4m\r\nLaminate wood flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom No.5 / Home Office\r\n3.4m x 2.6m\r\nLaminate wood flooring. Recessed LED lighting.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n4.1m x 2.5m\r\nFully tiled. Fitted vanity unit with WHB and extensive storage, bath & separate quadrant shower. \r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nBedroom No.1\r\n7.9m x 5.5m\r\nExtra-large bedroom. Walk in wardrobe / dressing room. Ensuite off. T&G Wood Flooring, Recessed LED lighting.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\n3.7m x 2.4m\r\nFully tiled. Electric shower.\r\n\r\nBedroom No.2\r\n7.6m x 3.7m\r\n\r\nLanding\r\n‘Keylite’ insulated, airtight attic ladder to storage.\r\n\r\nHot Press\r\n1.8m x 0.9m\r\nInsulated cylinder.\r\n\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\n\r\nGarage / Workshop.\r\nRoller shutter door. Mezzanine storage. \r\nRecently installed energy efficient condensing boiler.\r\n\r\nTimber Garden Store."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Oil Fired & Solid Fuel C.H. - Solid fuel 23 KW Stove.\r\nDouble glazed uPVC windows & external doors.\r\nDriveway with dual gated access.\r\nNew roof to entire residence.\r\nNew uPVC fascia, soffit, gutters and downpipes. Lighting in soffit.\r\nNew insulation to attic & original walls.\r\nNew internal joinery to Ground Floor – doors (half-hour fire doors), skirting, architraves & staircase.\r\nPine doors, architraves & skirting to First Floor.\r\nMains water. Recently installed septic tank.\r\nHigh speed broadband. Alarm.\r\nInclusions: Curtains, blinds and light fittings. American fridge freezer, dish washer & larder fridges in utility and kitchen \r\nLocation: Sligo 20 km / Ballintogher 7 km / Dromahaire 9.2 km / Riverstown 10 km / Ballyfarnon 15 km"
      },
      {
